      "note": "Exhibit B (Statement of Activities) heading prints 'For the Year Ended September 30, 2024', but its figures are FY2025: net position 598,617 / 962,210 at September 30 agree with the 9/30/2025 Exhibit A and the FY2025 fund statements. Recorded as FY2025."
    }
